  \texttt{hasse.font} & The name of the font family used for all text included in the Hasse diagram. Standard and safe font families to choose are "sans", "serif", and "mono". If the design's factor labels contain Unicode characters, or for consistency with Hasse diagrams of restricted layout structures using \texttt{hasserls}, a Unicode friendly font family should be selected. More details on Unicode friendly family options are in Section \ref{subsec:hasserls}. The default is "sans". \\
