In this study, we built the \textbf{Agent Ideate} framework, which is a Multi-Agent architecture leveraging an external search tool for generating product ideas from patent text. The pipeline diagram is illustrated in Figure \ref{fig:agent_ideate}. We leverage an LLM-based judging approach to evaluate the ideas generated by the different methods and to select the most effective one. 
