\section{Results and Discussions}

Evaluation results of the autoencoder are provided in Table~\ref{tab:autoencoder_metrics}. STFT and MEL reconstruction results prove that the autoencoder is effective at accurately encoding and decoding spatial audio. Evaluation of the spatial accuracy shows that the autoencoder near perfectly preserves the spatial attributes of the audio during the compression process. 

