Plain severe and full meet revisions are not learnable by
Theorem~\ref{theorem-plainsevere-learnable} and
Theorem~\ref{theorem-fullmeet-learnable}.
%
They are not amnesic by
Theorem~\ref{theorem-plainsevere-amnesic} and
Theorem~\ref{theorem-fullmeet-amnesic}.
%
They are not damascan by
Theorem~\ref{theorem-plainsevere-damascan} and
Theorem~\ref{theorem-fullmeet-damascan}.
%
They are dogmatic by
Theorem~\ref{theorem-plainsevere-dogmatic} and
Theorem~\ref{theorem-fullmeet-dogmatic}.



