\begin{eqnarray*}
C \sev(\{I\}) &=& [
	\min(\{I\}),
	C(0) \cup \cdots \cup C(\imin(\{I\})) \backslash \{I\},
	C(\imin(\{I\})+1), \ldots, C(\last)
]
\\
&=& [
	\{I\},
	C(0) \cup \cdots \cup C(\last) \backslash \{I\},
	C(\last+1), \ldots, C(\last)]
]
\\
&=& [
	\{I\},
	C(0) \cup \cdots \cup C(\last) \backslash \{I\}
]
\\
&=& [
	I,
	\true \backslash I
]
\end{eqnarray*}

Severe revision is not amnesic, it never generates the flat order, but this
order is close to it.

